<title>USA: Mediq Inc Q4 shr loss widens.</title>
<headline>Mediq Inc Q4 shr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>PENNSAUKEN, N.J. 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mediq Inc announced fourth-quarter and fiscal year results for the year ended September 30.</p>
<p>3 months ended September 30:</p>
<p>		     1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary loss$0.69	 loss     $0.22</p>
<p> Net loss	  $17,084     loss     5,331</p>
<p> Revs		32,588		   30,265</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary25,202		   24,697</p>
<p>	   year ended September 30</p>
<p> Shr primary loss$0.63		    $0.20</p>
<p> Net		 15,704		   4,947</p>
<p> Revs		136,066		  132,241</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary24,967		   24,604</p>
<p>(All data above 000s. Included in fourth-quarter net loss data was loss from discontinued operations of $0.47-share for 1996 and $0.12-share for 1995. For fiscal 1996 loss from discontinued operations was $0.43-share and a $0.06-share for 1995.)</p>
